(38, 'Italia', 'italia', 'internacional', 'Italia', 'Europa', 'Europa', 'Italia', 'Roma, Venecia y Florencia: arte e historia en cada rincón.', 'Italia es un museo a cielo abierto. El Coliseo de Roma, los canales de Venecia, el arte de Florencia y la Costa Amalfitana son solo el comienzo.', 'https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/de/Colosseo_2020.jpg/1920px-Colosseo_2020.jpg', array['https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/de/Colosseo_2020.jpg/1920px-Colosseo_2020.jpg', 'https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/17/Panorama_of_Canal_Grande_and_Ponte_di_Rialto%2C_Venice_-_September_2017.jpg/1920px-Panorama_of_Canal_Grande_and_Ponte_di_Rialto%2C_Venice_-_September_2017.jpg', 'https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a3/Canal_Grande_Chiesa_della_Salute_e_Dogana_dal_ponte_dell_Accademia.jpg/1920px-Canal_Grande_Chiesa_della_Salute_e_Dogana_dal_ponte_dell_Accademia.jpg', 'https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/27/%28Venice%29_Francesco_Albotto_-_Canal_Grande_con_San_Simeon_Piccolo_e_la_chiesa_degli_Scalzi_verso_Santa_Lucia_-_Pinacoteca_Querini_Stampalia.jpg/1920px-%28Venice%29_Francesco_Albotto_-_Canal_Grande_con_San_Simeon_Piccolo_e_la_chiesa_degli_Scalzi_verso_Santa_Lucia_-_Pinacoteca_Querini_Stampalia.jpg', 'https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/65/%28Venice%29_Rio_and_chiesa_di_San_Vidal_viewed_from_Grand_Canal.jpg/1920px-%28Venice%29_Rio_and_chiesa_di_San_Vidal_viewed_from_Grand_Canal.jpg']::text[], array['cultural', 'romantico', 'gastronomia']::text[], array['Coliseo y Foro Romano', 'Paseo en góndola', 'Galería Uffizi', 'Costa Amalfitana']::text[], array['Roma', 'Venecia', 'Florencia', 'Milán', 'Costa Amalfitana']::text[], null, '[{"titulo":"Colosseo 2020.jpg","fuente":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Colosseo_2020.jpg"},{"titulo":"Panorama of Canal Grande and Ponte di Rialto, Venice - September 2017.jpg","fuente":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Panorama_of_Canal_Grande_and_Ponte_di_Rialto,_Venice_-_September_2017.jpg"},{"titulo":"Canal Grande Chiesa della Salute e Dogana dal ponte dell Accademia.jpg","fuente":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Canal_Grande_Chiesa_della_Salute_e_Dogana_dal_ponte_dell_Accademia.jpg"},{"titulo":"(Venice) Francesco Albotto - Canal Grande con San Simeon Piccolo e la chiesa degli Scalzi verso Santa Lucia - Pinacoteca Querini Stampalia.jpg","fuente":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:(Venice)_Francesco_Albotto_-_Canal_Grande_con_San_Simeon_Piccolo_e_la_chiesa_degli_Scalzi_verso_Santa_Lucia_-_Pinacoteca_Querini_Stampalia.jpg"},{"titulo":"(Venice) Rio and chiesa di San Vidal viewed from Grand Canal.jpg","fuente":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:(Venice)_Rio_and_chiesa_di_San_Vidal_viewed_from_Grand_Canal.jpg"}]'::jsonb, false, 'activo'),
(39, 'Suiza', 'suiza', 'internacional', 'Suiza', 'Europa', 'Europa', 'Suiza', 'Alpes, lagos cristalinos y trenes panorámicos.', 'Suiza ofrece paisajes de montaña espectaculares, lagos de aguas cristalinas y ciudades ordenadas y elegantes. Sus trenes panorámicos son una experiencia en sí mismos.', 'https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/60/Matterhorn_from_Domh%C3%BCtte_-_2.jpg_unscaled', array['https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/60/Matterhorn_from_Domh%C3%BCtte_-_2.jpg_unscaled', 'https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/49/Lucerne_Pilatus_Lake_panoramic_1180662.jpg/1920px-Lucerne_Pilatus_Lake_panoramic_1180662.jpg', 'https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/90/Lucerne_and_Pilatus_from_Rigi_20210905.jpg/1920px-Lucerne_and_Pilatus_from_Rigi_20210905.jpg', 'https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d7/Lucerne_Lake_Pilatus_panoramic_P1170968.jpg/1920px-Lucerne_Lake_Pilatus_panoramic_P1170968.jpg']::text[], array['naturaleza', 'romantico', 'aventura']::text[], array['Trenes panorámicos', 'Ascenso a montañas alpinas', 'Recorrido por Lucerna', 'Chocolate y quesos suizos']::text[], array['Zermatt y el Matterhorn', 'Lucerna', 'Interlaken', 'Zúrich']::text[], null, '[{"titulo":"Matterhorn from Domhütte - 2.jpg","fuente":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Matterhorn_from_Domh%C3%BCtte_-_2.jpg"},{"titulo":"Lucerne Pilatus Lake panoramic 1180662.jpg","fuente":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Lucerne_Pilatus_Lake_panoramic_1180662.jpg"},{"titulo":"Lucerne and Pilatus from Rigi 20210905.jpg","fuente":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Lucerne_and_Pilatus_from_Rigi_20210905.jpg"},{"titulo":"Lucerne Lake Pilatus panoramic P1170968.jpg","fuente":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Lucerne_Lake_Pilatus_panoramic_P1170968.jpg"}]'::jsonb, false, 'activo'),
(40, 'Alemania', 'alemania', 'internacional', 'Alemania', 'Europa', 'Europa', 'Alemania', 'Castillos, historia y ciudades llenas de cultura.', 'Alemania combina historia y modernidad: Berlín y su legado histórico, Múnich y sus tradiciones, y castillos de cuento como Neuschwanstein.', 'https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f8/Schloss_Neuschwanstein_2013.jpg/1920px-Schloss_Neuschwanstein_2013.jpg', array['https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f8/Schloss_Neuschwanstein_2013.jpg/1920px-Schloss_Neuschwanstein_2013.jpg', 'https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/ef/Brandenburg_Gate_Quadriga_at_Night.jpg/1920px-Brandenburg_Gate_Quadriga_at_Night.jpg', 'https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b1/Brandenburger_Tor_morgens.jpg/1920px-Brandenburger_Tor_morgens.jpg', 'https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b9/Brandenburger_Tor_nachts.jpg/1920px-Brandenburger_Tor_nachts.jpg', 'https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/01/Brandenburger_Tor_nachts_2012-07.jpg/1920px-Brandenburger_Tor_nachts_2012-07.jpg']::text[], array['cultural', 'ciudad']::text[], array['Castillo de Neuschwanstein', 'Puerta de Brandeburgo', 'Recorrido por Múnich', 'Ruta Romántica']::text[], array['Berlín', 'Múnich', 'Neuschwanstein', 'Colonia']::text[], null, '[{"titulo":"Schloss Neuschwanstein 2013.jpg","fuente":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Schloss_Neuschwanstein_2013.jpg"},{"titulo":"Brandenburg Gate Quadriga at Night.jpg","fuente":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Brandenburg_Gate_Quadriga_at_Night.jpg"},{"titulo":"Brandenburger Tor morgens.jpg","fuente":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Brandenburger_Tor_morgens.jpg"},{"titulo":"Brandenburger Tor nachts.jpg","fuente":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Brandenburger_Tor_nachts.jpg"},{"titulo":"Brandenburger Tor nachts 2012-07.jpg","fuente":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Brandenburger_Tor_nachts_2012-07.jpg"}]'::jsonb, false, 'activo'),
(41, 'Dubái', 'dubai', 'internacional', 'Emiratos Árabes Unidos', 'Otros destinos', 'Asia', 'Emiratos Árabes Unidos', 'Lujo, arquitectura futurista y aventuras en el desierto.', 'Dubái impresiona con el Burj Khalifa, sus islas artificiales, centros comerciales y safaris por el desierto. Un destino donde la tradición árabe y la modernidad conviven.', 'https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/90/Burj_Khalifa_%28worlds_tallest_building%29_and_the_Dubai_skyline_%2825781049892%29.jpg/1920px-Burj_Khalifa_%28worlds_tallest_building%29_and_the_Dubai_skyline_%2825781049892%29.jpg', array['https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/90/Burj_Khalifa_%28worlds_tallest_building%29_and_the_Dubai_skyline_%2825781049892%29.jpg/1920px-Burj_Khalifa_%28worlds_tallest_building%29_and_the_Dubai_skyline_%2825781049892%29.jpg', 'https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/ae/Dubai_Marina_Skyline_93.jpg/1920px-Dubai_Marina_Skyline_93.jpg', 'https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a0/Evening_Skyline_Marina.jpg/1920px-Evening_Skyline_Marina.jpg', 'https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e6/Dubai_Marina_Skyline.jpg/1920px-Dubai_Marina_Skyline.jpg', 'https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/10/Dubai_Marina_and_Skyline_from_Le_Royal_M%C3%A9ridien_Beach_Resort_and_Spa.jpg/1920px-Dubai_Marina_and_Skyline_from_Le_Royal_M%C3%A9ridien_Beach_Resort_and_Spa.jpg']::text[], array['ciudad', 'aventura', 'romantico']::text[], array['Burj Khalifa', 'Safari en el desierto', 'Dubai Marina', 'Zocos del oro y las especias']::text[], array['Burj Khalifa', 'Dubai Mall', 'Palm Jumeirah', 'Dubai Marina']::text[], null, '[{"titulo":"Burj Khalifa (worlds tallest building) and the Dubai skyline (25781049892).jpg","fuente":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Burj_Khalifa_(worlds_tallest_building)_and_the_Dubai_skyline_(25781049892).jpg"},{"titulo":"Dubai Marina Skyline 93.jpg","fuente":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Dubai_Marina_Skyline_93.jpg"},{"titulo":"Evening Skyline Marina.jpg","fuente":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Evening_Skyline_Marina.jpg"},{"titulo":"Dubai Marina Skyline.jpg","fuente":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Dubai_Marina_Skyline.jpg"},{"titulo":"Dubai Marina and Skyline from Le Royal Méridien Beach Resort and Spa.jpg","fuente":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Dubai_Marina_and_Skyline_from_Le_Royal_M%C3%A9ridien_Beach_Resort_and_Spa.jpg"}]'::jsonb, true, 'activo'),
(42, 'Turquía', 'turquia', 'internacional', 'Turquía', 'Otros destinos', 'Asia', 'Turquía', 'Estambul entre dos continentes y globos sobre Capadocia.', 'Turquía es un puente entre Europa y Asia. Estambul sorprende con sus mezquitas y bazares, y Capadocia con sus paisajes únicos y vuelos en globo al amanecer.', 'https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/59/Cappadocia_balloon_trip%2C_Ortahisar_Castle_%2811893715185%29.jpg/1920px-Cappadocia_balloon_trip%2C_Ortahisar_Castle_%2811893715185%29.jpg', array['https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/59/Cappadocia_balloon_trip%2C_Ortahisar_Castle_%2811893715185%29.jpg/1920px-Cappadocia_balloon_trip%2C_Ortahisar_Castle_%2811893715185%29.jpg', 'https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/22/Hagia_Sophia_Mars_2013.jpg/1920px-Hagia_Sophia_Mars_2013.jpg']::text[], array['cultural', 'romantico', 'aventura']::text[], array['Vuelo en globo en Capadocia', 'Santa Sofía y Mezquita Azul', 'Gran Bazar', 'Crucero por el Bósforo']::text[], array['Estambul', 'Capadocia', 'Pamukkale', 'Éfeso']::text[], null, '[{"titulo":"Cappadocia balloon trip, Ortahisar Castle (11893715185).jpg","fuente":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Cappadocia_balloon_trip,_Ortahisar_Castle_(11893715185).jpg"},{"titulo":"Hagia Sophia Mars 2013.jpg","fuente":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Hagia_Sophia_Mars_2013.jpg"}]'::jsonb, false, 'activo'),
(43, 'Japón', 'japon', 'internacional', 'Japón', 'Otros destinos', 'Asia', 'Japón', 'Tradición milenaria y modernidad en perfecta armonía.', 'Japón combina templos milenarios, jardines zen y ciudades futuristas. Tokio, Kioto y el Monte Fuji forman una ruta inolvidable.', 'https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f8/View_of_Mount_Fuji_from_%C5%8Cwakudani_20211202.jpg/1920px-View_of_Mount_Fuji_from_%C5%8Cwakudani_20211202.jpg', array['https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f8/View_of_Mount_Fuji_from_%C5%8Cwakudani_20211202.jpg/1920px-View_of_Mount_Fuji_from_%C5%8Cwakudani_20211202.jpg', 'https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/99/Sunlight_through_clouds_and_view_of_Ginkaku-ji_Temple_from_above%2C_Kyoto%2C_Japan.jpg/1920px-Sunlight_through_clouds_and_view_of_Ginkaku-ji_Temple_from_above%2C_Kyoto%2C_Japan.jpg', 'https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f7/Ninna-ji%27s_Golden_Hall%2C_front_view_of_the_Shingon_Buddhist_temple%2C_Uky%C5%8D-ku%2C_Kyoto%2C_Japan.jpg/1920px-Ninna-ji%27s_Golden_Hall%2C_front_view_of_the_Shingon_Buddhist_temple%2C_Uky%C5%8D-ku%2C_Kyoto%2C_Japan.jpg', 'https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/ed/Yasaka-dori_early_morning_with_street_lanterns_and_the_Tower_of_Yasaka_%28Hokan-ji_Temple%29%2C_Kyoto%2C_Japan.jpg/1920px-Yasaka-dori_early_morning_with_street_lanterns_and_the_Tower_of_Yasaka_%28Hokan-ji_Temple%29%2C_Kyoto%2C_Japan.jpg']::text[], array['cultural', 'ciudad', 'gastronomia']::text[], array['Recorrido por Tokio', 'Templos de Kioto', 'Vista del Monte Fuji', 'Gastronomía japonesa']::text[], array['Tokio', 'Kioto', 'Monte Fuji', 'Osaka', 'Nara']::text[], null, '[{"titulo":"View of Mount Fuji from Ōwakudani 20211202.jpg","fuente":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:View_of_Mount_Fuji_from_%C5%8Cwakudani_20211202.jpg"},{"titulo":"Sunlight through clouds and view of Ginkaku-ji Temple from above, Kyoto, Japan.jpg","fuente":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Sunlight_through_clouds_and_view_of_Ginkaku-ji_Temple_from_above,_Kyoto,_Japan.jpg"},{"titulo":"Ninna-ji''s Golden Hall, front view of the Shingon Buddhist temple, Ukyō-ku, Kyoto, Japan.jpg","fuente":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Ninna-ji%27s_Golden_Hall,_front_view_of_the_Shingon_Buddhist_temple,_Uky%C5%8D-ku,_Kyoto,_Japan.jpg"},{"titulo":"Yasaka-dori early morning with street lanterns and the Tower of Yasaka (Hokan-ji Temple), Kyoto, Japan.jpg","fuente":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Yasaka-dori_early_morning_with_street_lanterns_and_the_Tower_of_Yasaka_(Hokan-ji_Temple),_Kyoto,_Japan.jpg"}]'::jsonb, false, 'activo')
